Moon's Sphere</b>

13:59.147 --> 14:04.627
Furthermore, the heavens are eight layers 
of spheres revolving in place,

14:04.627 --> 14:07.797
and we reside in the center.

14:09.537 --> 14:11.087
Let's see...

14:11.617 --> 14:13.597
Oh? How amusing.

14:14.537 --> 14:15.817
Amusing?

14:15.817 --> 14:16.877
Hey, don't you...

14:17.317 --> 14:20.097
Yes. It's different from what I know.

14:20.687 --> 14:26.657
What I heard long ago is that the stars
are livestock tied to a pillar in heaven.

14:27.387 --> 14:30.427
That pillar is the star in the north sky
 that doesn't move.

14:31.477 --> 14:34.607
With all due respect, 
that is mere superstition.

14:35.037 --> 14:36.147
Do you think so?

14:36.847 --> 14:41.977
For all we know, our world could very well
be a galloping horse bound to a rope.

14:42.667 --> 14:47.477
On that horse are myself, Boraqchin,
 Sorghaghtani, and Tolui.

14:47.817 --> 14:49.607
Plus you and Töregene.

14:49.607 --> 14:54.457
All of us riding atop, circling around 
as we head towards the same destination.

14:54.457 --> 14:57.877
That's unthinkable. It goes against
 the very concept of science.

14:59.297 --> 15:00.317
"Science"?

15:02.177 --> 15:05.197
By science, I refer to the laws 
that govern nature.

15:05.947 --> 15:09.247
The work of Allah, who created the world 
and bestowed it to us.

15:10.127 --> 15:13.067
Science is the discipline 
that seeks to study this.

15:15.117 --> 15:18.867
But in that case, 
there are the spirits the kams speak of.

15:18.867 --> 15:21.947
I would say their existence 
explains the laws of nature just as well.

15:22.167 --> 15:22.857
No.

15:23.117 --> 15:28.587
The Quran tells us Allah made the stars
 move across the sky to guide us.

15:28.587 --> 15:32.777
The positions and paths of the stars 
are calculated with Earth at the center,

15:32.777 --> 15:34.917
giving us results without contradiction.

15:34.917 --> 15:37.957
What more proof do you need 
to see that this is the truth?

15:37.957 --> 15:40.377
Anything else is a mere figment!

15:48.327 --> 15:49.427
I see now.

15:49.727 --> 15:52.017
I imagine you get along very well
 with Töregene.

15:53.307 --> 15:55.407
How about you and I have a wager?

15:56.417 --> 15:57.677
A wager?

15:58.087 --> 16:02.147
Yes. But one where all 
you have to do is watch.

16:03.237 --> 16:07.007
In the days ahead, I will bring prosperity
to the Mongol Empire.

16:07.697 --> 16:09.987
With methods unlike those
 of my father or Tolui.

16:11.717 --> 16:15.377
So that you and Töregene 
can find happiness.

16:15.377 --> 16:16.777
Happiness?

16:17.517 --> 16:18.437
That's right.

16:19.457 --> 16:24.177
When I first laid eyes upon Töregene, 
I realized what my duty is.

16:24.627 --> 16:26.887
I must create the Mongol Empire anew.

16:28.127 --> 16:31.207
For the sake of the look 
in her eyes above all.

16:32.477 --> 16:35.107
You've lost your homeland 
and family as well, no?

16:36.817 --> 16:38.017
Your eyes earlier...

16:38.437 --> 16:41.337
They were the very image 
of Töregene's on that day.

16:44.477 --> 16:47.477
Watch my actions 
with those very same eyes.

16:48.777 --> 16:51.227
If you two manage 
to find happiness here...

16:52.727 --> 16:53.817
then victory is mine.

18:07.077 --> 18:08.197
Fatima?

18:09.647 --> 18:10.687
Fatima!

18:10.687 --> 18:12.207
Ah, Lady Töregene!

18:12.597 --> 18:13.977
Fatima, are you all right?

18:14.597 --> 18:18.117
Um, yes. And you, Lady Töregene?

18:19.817 --> 18:21.617
You know, Fatima...

18:22.647 --> 18:24.417
I've been thinking.

18:32.677 --> 18:36.177
I won't go live with my darling Güyük.

18:36.177 --> 18:36.877
Huh?

18:37.247 --> 18:40.907
Why, doing that would be just what 
the Great Kha'an wants.

18:42.417 --> 18:44.747
The very thought frustrates me.

18:47.457 --> 18:50.267
Fatima, will you...

18:51.707 --> 18:54.987
Will you fight alongside me once again?

18:58.577 --> 18:59.687
I'm...

19:01.737 --> 19:04.747
I'm not clever in the slightest, you know.

19:19.147 --> 19:22.397
Let the two of us summon a storm.

19:23.667 --> 19:24.987
<i>That's right.</i>

19:25.527 --> 19:30.197
<i>I'm not fighting the Great Kha'an
 all by myself.</i>

19:31.497 --> 19:32.487
This empire...

19:33.747 --> 19:36.647
And the Mongols 
who took everything from us...

19:37.377 --> 19:39.987
We will never let them 
be thought of as good.

19:42.607 --> 19:44.897
Now it's our turn...

19:48.897 --> 19:50.497
...to become witches.

